<!--
  START gate panel: a mode picker over the persistent START button.

  Heights lock the split at exactly 3:1. flex-grow alone distributes only the
  space left after each item's content basis, which let the button section eat
  into the quarter; pairing flex-grow with flex-basis: 0 makes the mode section
  take 3/4 and the START section 1/4 regardless of their contents. The mode
  section is a plain <div> with a transparent background: a Horizon <Panel>
  carries the kit's glass default and paints a second white plate around the
  rows. Each mode row is a lowercase <button> so its class fill renders
  exactly (Container, no kit material).

  The leading glyph is sized 15 inside a 4-unit row padding so it stays a
  compact checkbox rather than a panel-sized block. border-radius 12 makes the
  row read as a near-capsule wedge (row height is about 33.5). The label grows
  to fill the area right of the icon and centres its text inside that area.

  Both rows are selectable: DESIGN runs the designer sandbox battery, ENDLESS
  the DDT-driven endless defence. Selection reads through the row fill — the
  active row takes the dark plate with a white label, the idle row keeps the
  light-grey fill with dark text. The glyphs stay fixed (outline for DESIGN,
  solid for ENDLESS) so no runtime svg swap is needed; StartPanelSystem
  toggles the -active classes on click and defaults the pick to ENDLESS.

  Icons load through the <svg> tag (uikit Svg -> SVGLoader), which builds fill
  geometry only and drops strokes entirely. The requested streamline
  "select-all" outline is stroke-only, so mode-select.svg carries the same
  geometry baked into filled rect subpaths; the solid variant keeps its fill
  and gets a hardcoded colour because currentColor resolves to black. src
  resolves against the page base URL (not this file), so the ui/ prefix is
  required.

  Panel surface: stock glass preset over a light-grey background; the hex8
  alpha channel (0.75) doubles as the panel surface opacity (0.25 see-through).
  UIKitML style blocks do not support CSS comments.
-->
<style>
  .panel-root {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100;
    height: 100;
    border-radius: 4;
    padding-top: 4;
    padding-right: 4;
    padding-bottom: 4;
    padding-left: 4;
    panel-material-class: glass;
    background-color: #ffffffaa;
  }

  .mode-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 3;
    flex-basis: 0;
    gap: 2;
    background-color: #00000000;
  }

  .mode-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-basis: 0;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3;
    border-radius: 12;
    background-color: #c9ced6;
    padding-top: 4;
    padding-right: 4;
    padding-bottom: 4;
    padding-left: 4;
  }

  .mode-row-active {
    background-color: #26262b;
  }

  .mode-icon {
    display: flex;
    width: 15;
    height: 15;
    background-color: #00000000;
  }

  .mode-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-grow: 1;
    font-size: 7;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: #00000000;
  }

  .mode-label-on {
    color: #26262b;
  }

  .mode-label-active {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .start-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-basis: 0;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .start-button {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    width: 60;
    height: 16;
    background-color: #26262b;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 6;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 3;
    padding-top: 0;
    padding-right: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .start-button:hover {
    background-color: #3a3a42;
  }

  .start-button:active {
    background-color: #1c1c21;
  }
</style>

<Panel class="panel-root">
  <div class="mode-section">
    <button id="mode-design" class="mode-row">
      <svg class="mode-icon" src="ui/icons/mode-select.svg" />
      <div id="mode-design-label" class="mode-label mode-label-on">DESIGN</div>
    </button>
    <button id="mode-endless" class="mode-row mode-row-active">
      <svg class="mode-icon" src="ui/icons/mode-select-solid.svg" />
      <div id="mode-endless-label" class="mode-label mode-label-active">ENDLESS</div>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="start-section">
    <button id="start-button" class="start-button">START</button>
  </div>
</Panel>
